      "writtenOn": "2026-04-21T18:29:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "### Logic Flaw in Device Status Tracking (`iapcontrol.h` / `.cc`)\n\n**Issue:** In `iapcontrol.h`, `m_deviceCount` is initialized to `1` (`int m_deviceCount \u003d 1;`).\n**Impact:** When `connectDevice` is called for the first time, if a device is found (`count \u003e 0`), the code checks `if (m_deviceCount)` and immediately returns `DEVSTA_EXISTED` instead of `DEVSTA_INSERT`. It will never successfully register an insertion event.\n**Recommendation:** Initialize `m_deviceCount` to `0` in `iapcontrol.h`.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 70,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 70,
        "endChar": 23
      },
      "revId": "d8fed2004e8fb6edb9673b6e6e59537ac06bc029",
